# Proxy format examples
# Format 1: host:port:username:password
proxy1.example.com:8080:myusername:mypassword
proxy2.example.com:3128:user123:pass456

# Format 2: host:port (for proxies without authentication)
127.0.0.1:8888
192.168.1.100:3128

# You can mix both formats in the same file
# Remove the # symbols to activate the proxies
# One proxy per line